<title>CANADA: GOLF-FINAL LEADING SCORES AT LPGA DU MAURIER CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL LEADING SCORES AT LPGA DU MAURIER CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>OAKVILLE, Ontario 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>the final round of the LPGA du Maurier Classic golf tournament</p>
<p>won by Coleen Walker on Sunday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>278 Coleen Walker 68 72 73 65</p>
<p>280 Liselotte Neumann (Sweden) 71 67 73 69</p>
<p>281 Betsy King 71 69 72 69, Kelly Robbins 71 65 73 72</p>
<p>282 Cindy Figg-Currier 69 74 69 70, Juli Inkster 70 69 71 72</p>
<p>283 Rosie Jones 69 71 71 72, Emilee Klein 73 70 71 69</p>
<p>284 Lisa Hackney (Britain) 73 69 75 67, Chris Johnson 70 72</p>
<p>72 70</p>
<p>285 Jene Geddes 74 69 74 68, Donna Andrews 71 69 76 69,</p>
<p>Brandie Burton 69 75 66 75</p>
<p>286 Helen Alfredsson (Sweden) 75 70 69 72, Tina Barrett 71 71</p>
<p>70 74</p>
<p>287 Rachel Hetherington 73 72 74 68, Kris Tschetter 72 73 74</p>
<p>68, Hiromi Kobayashi (Japan) 71 73 72 71, Laura Davies</p>
<p>(Briton) 73 70 73 71, Danielle Ammaccapane 71 75 69 72, Deb</p>
<p>Richard 72 73 70 72, Kim Saiki 75 69 71 72, Wendy Ward 72 71</p>
<p>72 72</p>
